  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-object-detection-yolo:\n\n- Provides offline remote sensing object detection using sliding window, HOG or intensity features, non-maximum suppression (NMS), and geographic output.\n- Outputs detection results as GeoJSON (with WGS-84 coordinates), a score raster, and a run manifest JSON.\n- Accepts both real GeoTIFF imagery and built-in synthetic data mode for testing.\n- Fully numpy-based; does not require torch or ultralytics.\n- All computation is performed locally, ensuring user privacy.",
